{
  "name": "TurboDiffusion",
  "description": "TurboDiffusion is a high-performance video generation acceleration framework designed to speed up end-to-end diffusion models by 100-200x with minimal quality degradation. It integrates SageAttention and Sparse-Linear Attention (SLA) for efficient transformer inference, alongside rectified Consistency Models (rCM) for aggressive timestep distillation. The system provides specialized CUDA and Triton kernels, context parallelism, and quantization support for deploying state-of-the-art models like Wan-2.1 and Wan-2.2 on modern hardware.",
